OL,3,GNEWSAGroup selected to spend #20m in
OL,4,Acommunity
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in one of the most deprived
OL,7,Fareas of a county say they are excited
OL,8,Fto decide how to spend #20m of funding
OL,9,Fover the next decade.
OL,11,FA board of 20 local people from Matson
OL,12,Fand Robinswood in Gloucester have been
OL,13,Fselected to determine how money from
OL,14,Fthe government's Pride in Place scheme
OL,15,Fshould be invested.
OL,17,FLatest figures show Matson and
OL,18,FRobinswood is the most deprived council
OL,19,Fward in Gloucestershire, with the
OL,20,Flowest income and employment rates.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
