OL,3,GNEWSAGroup selected to spend #20m in
OL,4,Acommunity
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-vice board chair Naomi Draper said
OL,7,Fshe was "very proud" to part of the
OL,8,Fproject which would benefit the
OL,9,F"supportive" and "tight-knit" community
OL,10,Fshe loves.
